<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 2</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 2</h3>Helm has two main slot options for Ulduar: T8 and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45472/warhelm-of-the-champion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_134.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warhelm of the Champion</span></a>. T8 is BiS in the set you will most likely run (4 set T8) and is not only far easier to obtain in the raid (not requiring Thorim HM to be defeated) but can also be obtained from badges.<br/>
<br/>Before these items, either stay with your <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44006/obsidian-greathelm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_95.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Greathelm</span></a> or T7 helm: of the other helms available to us, only <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45993/mimirons-flight-goggles">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gizmo_newgoggles.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mimiron's Flight Goggles</span></a> is of any value, and should never be taken of any of the other helms due to the ease of access of T8.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44879/arcanum-of-torment">
