<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 2</h3>The cloak slot in T8 can lead to some confusion. While Algalon awards <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45588/drape-of-the-skyborn">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of the Skyborn</span></a> from his quest turnin, this item is extremely weak compared not only to other options from that quest, but also from the instance as a whole. As a result, the cloak of choice is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46032/drape-of-the-faceless-general">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_14.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of the Faceless General</span></a>, providing a variety of stats that all help our cause.<br/>
<br/>If this cloak cannot be obtained, you can also use either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45138/drape-of-the-drakerider">
