<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 2</h3>Waist becomes another simple slot in T8 when running with a hit heavy setup (such as when using a polearm) - Yogg-Saron when done with 1 keeper active in 10M rewards <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46095/soul-devouring-cinch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_37c.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soul-Devouring Cinch</span></a>, providing a strong spread of stats as well as some important expertise. However, when running the more contested Sword setup, we will prefer picking up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45241/belt-of-colossal-rage">
