<br/>If you find yourself unable to obtain this item, you can try and pick up the slightly less contested <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46041/starfall-girdle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_48a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starfall Girdle</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45550/belt-of-the-titans">
