<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 2</h3>Legs are an awkward spot in T8. While there are two outstanding options available in both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45536/legguards-of-cunning-deception">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of Cunning Deception</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45134/plated-leggings-of-ruination">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_25.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Plated Leggings of Ruination</span></a>, both of these are highly contested by other classes, and come from hard modes in 25M, making them a rare sight. Tier 8 legs are also horrifically statted, with far too much hit on a spec that struggles to drop hit at points, as well as a borderline unhealthy dose of expertise that may be wasted when other BiS options are equipped, such as belt or bracers.<br/>
<br/>If possible, try and secure a set of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45536/legguards-of-cunning-deception">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_leather_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of Cunning Deception</span></a> early - these legs will be a massive upgrade from anything else you can equip reasonably, and will help you not need to worry about overcapping other stats such as hit and expertise in T8.<div class="pad"></div>
