<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 2</h3>Two strong options present themselves at the forefront in T8, both from 25M hardmodes - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45517/pendulum-of-infinity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendulum of Infinity</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45459/frigid-strength-of-hodir">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frigid Strength of Hodir</span></a>. Both of these necks are just as good as each other, and are desired in different situations; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45459/frigid-strength-of-hodir">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frigid Strength of Hodir</span></a> can be useful for horde due to the increased hit requirement, or for Alliance players who don't reliably have a Draenei buff in their party, while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45517/pendulum-of-infinity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendulum of Infinity</span></a> doesn't have wasted stats on hit and provides a large amount of extra crit.<div class="pad"></div>
