<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 2</h3>Arms desires two Rings in Ulduar, and both of them are from the Algalon quest item - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45608/branns-signet-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_67.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brann's Signet Ring</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46322/branns-sealing-ring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_67.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brann's Sealing Ring</span></a>. However, as these can both be difficult to obtain, other options can include <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45456/loop-of-the-agile">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Loop of the Agile</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45525/godbane-signet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_54.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Godbane Signet</span></a> (if expertise is desired), or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46048/band-of-lights">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_68.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Lights</span></a> if hit is needed. In addition, when running a sword based configuration, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45534/seal-of-the-betrayed-king">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_76.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Betrayed King</span></a> is almost mandatory, due to its high hit budget and strong ilvl stat budget.<br/>
<br/>Due to their item level being increased, both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45690/inscribed-ring-of-the-kirin-tor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_74.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Ring of the Kirin Tor</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45688/inscribed-band-of-the-kirin-tor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_74.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Band of the Kirin Tor</span></a> are superior over any other ring option available leading into Ulduar, however their high price point makes them potentially undesirable to casual players. If you have the base versions of these rings left over from P1, make sure you upgrade them!<br/>
