<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 2</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="two-handed-weapons-for-arms-warrior-dps-in-phase-2">Two Handed Weapons for Arms Warrior DPS in Phase 2</h4>When running Poleaxes, our strongest weapon is the powerful <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45533/dark-edge-of-depravity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_halberd_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Edge of Depravity</span></a>. This polearm is one of the few 252 ilvl 2H weapons, allowing it to have a high stat budget (of which a lot is spent on hit, allowing us to use more non hit offset pieces).<br/>
<br/>However, Ulduar is one tier where (due to perculiar stat budgeting and weapon speeds) swords can eclipse poleaxes in DPS for Arms Warriors. Our best weapon when running Swords is the exceptional <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45516/voldrethar-dark-blade-of-oblivion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_136.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Voldrethar, Dark Blade of Oblivion</span></a>. With dual sockets, high stats, and an impressive item level, these swords will be our weapon of choice for T8.<br/>
<br/>However, due to the fact that it drops drop from General Vezax 25M HM, getting this may be quite a challenge, especially when it offers a mediocre upgrade to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45533/dark-edge-of-depravity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_halberd_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dark Edge of Depravity</span></a>, as well as being far above the other options for other classes/<wbr/>specs. Other options until then include <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45868/aesirs-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_136.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Aesir's Edge</span></a> from 10M XT, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45498/lotrafen-spear-of-the-damned">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_halberd_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lotrafen, Spear of the Damned</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45165/worldcarver">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_102.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Worldcarver</span></a>.<br/>
